# MNN-Pocket-0.3B

MNN-Pocket is a family of compact language models co-designed with the [MNN](https://github.com/alibaba/MNN) inference stack for **on-device deployment**. `MNN-Pocket-0.3B` is the general-purpose, instruction-tuned member of the family.

- **Tiny footprint**: ~300M parameters; the INT4 (W4A16) QAT MNN build occupies only **173 MB**.
- **Fast edge inference**: up to **466 tokens/s** decode on iPad Pro M5 (Metal), above the 200 tok/s real-time target.
- **Context length**: up to **32K tokens**.
- **Balanced bilingual capability**: best average (50.00) across 11 zh/en benchmarks among ~300M models, surpassing several ~500M baselines.

